      "writtenOn": "2019-07-12T17:47:23Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "It seems to me that en2_clr \u003d mask is missing in this case (3).  As is, I am not sure it will work if the pin it first set to alternate function 4, and later set to alternate function 3.\n\nActually, the datasheet https://datasheets.maximintegrated.com/en/ds/MAX32660.pdf mentions only alternate functions 1, 2, and 3.  So as far as I can tell, the case 4 should be removed, and then all references to en2_clr could be removed, as there is no way the bit will ever be set (does the chip even have a en2 bit, if it has only three alternate functions per pin.)",
